{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sun shines high in the sky. You arrive at a ruin in the desert, with only the vague promise of a priceless historical artefact hidden inside. Before you reach it, many dangers must be overcome. Can you find a path through this abandoned structure without losing your head?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Ruin Wanderer</i> is a small episodic homage to the classic <strong>female archeologist simulators</strong> from the 90's. It focuses on exploration and light puzzle solving in beautifully desolate environments.\u00a0Above all else, it is about atmosphere; just you, the silent ruins of a long gone civilization, and here and there a swinging blade or spike pit to watch out for.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTAINS:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One 15-30 minute level (with two more planned for the future)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat or dialogue, just a calm atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ruin with many traps and secrets to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk, climb, roll, shimmy, balance, crouch and/or crawl your way around</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Cloud Save support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 fps on Steam Deck</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Desert Raider","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3775390/39976c7be98ed91eba0165c8adbe235421799826.jpg"},{"name":"Splat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3775390/0a163b7533a558babd6efa47452841d4a8c4837b.jpg"},{"name":"Idolized","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3775390/98cfc3bad27a0cdad8084079f5d7c2d6b6c2fb05.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepageback